# The OCR sandbox (ADR-0028). Its own policy, deliberately different from the
# application's above — and the only place `'wasm-unsafe-eval'` is permitted.
#
# The application origin must never have it: that origin holds the GitHub token and
# the BYOK AI key. This document holds nothing. It is embedded with
# `sandbox="allow-scripts"` and no `allow-same-origin`, so it runs on an opaque origin
# with no access to the app's storage, and `connect-src 'self'` lets it load its own
# model files and reach nothing else.
#
# Two headers here exist to *undo* something, and the sandbox does not load without
# either of them. Both were found by running the spike in a real browser.
#
# `X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN` overrides the `DENY` this path inherits from `/*`.
# Cloudflare applies every matching rule rather than the most specific one, and a block
# only overrides the headers it names, so `/ocr/index.html` was being served `DENY`:
# unframeable from anywhere, same-origin included. Chromium enforces it; Firefox ignores
# it in favour of `frame-ancestors` and says so in the console. It has to be right for
# both.
#
# `Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: cross-origin` — and it cannot be anything stricter.
# This document runs on an **opaque origin**, which belongs to no site and no origin, so
# `same-site` and `same-origin` can never match it: the frame loads and is then refused
# every one of its own assets (`NS_ERROR_DOM_CORP_FAILED` on `sandbox.js`). `cross-origin`
# is the only value an opaque-origin document can satisfy.
#
# What that costs: these files become readable by any origin. They are the OCR engine
# and its models — public static assets with nothing user-specific in them — so the cost
# is hotlinking, not disclosure. Framing the sandbox *document* is still restricted by
# `frame-ancestors 'self'` above, and that is the control that matters.
/ocr/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; connect-src 'self'; img-src blob: data:; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
